Asset: android/app/src/full/assets/mobilefacenet.tflite
  (FULL flavor only — NOT shipped in the fdroid flavor)
Upstream: MobileFaceNet face-embedding weights (112x112 RGB -> 192-d).
Provenance: UNRESOLVED. No upstream URL, commit, or license was recorded
  when this file entered the repo, and a 2026-09-23 survey of public
  MobileFaceNet weights found every lineage rooted in research-only
  training data (MS-Celeb-1M incl. refined variants, VGGFace2,
  CASIA-WebFace) or carrying no explicit weights license — none of which
  meets F-Droid's freely-licensed binary requirement.
Status: excluded from `assembleFdroidRelease` via the `full`/`fdroid`
  flavor asset split (`src/full/assets/`). The fdroid build hides all
  recognition UI and forces recognition off at runtime
  (BuildConfig.FACE_RECOGNITION_SUPPORTED=false); the embedding loader
  degrades to plain face detection when the asset is absent.
Next step: either locate FLOSS-licensed weights with a FLOSS training set
  and document them here, or keep face recognition a full-flavor-only
  feature permanently (current decision).
Consumed by: detection/face/FaceEmbeddingEngine.kt (MODEL_ASSET).
